# React islands frontend build tooling (see docs/REACT_ISLANDS.md).
# static/react/*.js IS committed (placeholders until built, then real
# bundles), and so is frontend/package-lock.json once `npm install` has
# generated it, for reproducible builds -- only the Node tooling itself
# (node_modules) and Vite's default dist/ (unused; the real outDir is
# ../static/react/) are ignored.
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/

